# For test_card_old_save: on a build without the card feature, Jian wears the Blazing Ring in his accessory slot
# (0x020B46A0 = 0xCB, one in the bag) and the game is saved to album No.1 (Select, A, A).
include boot_from_save
wait 250
poke u8 0x0213B9FA 1
poke u16 0x020B46A0 0xCB
press Select 3
wait 150
press A 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 120
shot old_saved
